      "text": "Reinforcement learning is the study of agents that learn to act by interacting\nwith an environment, optimizing a scalar reward over time. Unlike supervised\nlearning, there is no labeled \"correct action\" — only a delayed, evaluative\nsignal. The whole field is downstream of one diagram and one equation."
